prompts.rule_format:
**FORMAT JSON:**
   {{
     "answer_text": "Voici {k} evenements...",
     "events": [EXACTEMENT {k} evenements]
   }}
   - Inclure TOUS les evenements des SOURCES
   - CONSOLIDATION: Meme evenement, meme jour, horaires differents → UNE carte avec times_display
     Exemple: {{"title": "Jazz Night", "date": "2026-02-15", "times_display": "19:30, 21:30"}}
   - SEPARATION: Meme evenement, jours differents → cartes separees
   - Champs: title, date, city, location, url, match_type (requis) + timings, price_label, age_label (si disponibles)
